<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Conshu interim shr dives, div down.</title>
<headline>Conshu interim shr dives, div down.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended Sept 30</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     17.0	  vs  41.0</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		  6.0	  vs  14.0</p>
<p>    Attrib income	    8.2	  vs  19.4</p>
<p>    Tax			  5.0	  vs  12.5</p>
<p>    Net financing cost     4.9	  vs   5.7</p>
<p>    Turnover		 396.5	  vs 406.1</p>
<p>Div payable Dec 31</p>
<p>on register Nov 29</p>
<p>Full name: Conshu Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The group said that earnings for the full year would continue to fall well short of those for the previous year. It said that there was uncertainty regarding the award of state and parastatal contracts.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
